 156:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 157:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \brief
 158:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function initializes the CapSense component.
 159:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 160:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \details
 161:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This API initializes all sub-modules of the CapSense component:
 162:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *   - Data Structure - set the default component parameters defined in the Customizer.
 163:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *   - Data Processing - resets all widget statuses.
 164:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *   - Tuner - resets tuning state.
 165:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *   - Sensing - prepares CSD HW for operation.
 166:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 167:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Note that Data Structure module is initialized only once after the reset or
 168:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense_Stop() API is called. The repeated calls of Initialize API
 169:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  will not re-initialize Data Structure. This is done to preserve component
 170:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  parameters that user may set in runtime.
 171:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 172:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  If default component parameters are needed the CapSense_DsInitialize()
 173:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  API must be called directly from the application code.
 174:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 175:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \return
 176:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Return CYRET_SUCCESS if the initialization was successful.
 177:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 178:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *******************************************************************************/
