 212:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 213:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function should be called when no scanning is in progress.
 214:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  I.e. CapSense_IsBusy() returns a non-busy status.
 215:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
