 278:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 279:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \brief
 280:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Performs full data processing of all enabled widgets.
 281:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 282:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \details
 283:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function performs all data processes for all enabled widgets in the
 284:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  component. The following tasks are executed as part of processing all the
 285:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  widgets:
 286:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    1. Apply raw-count filters to raw counts, if they are enabled in the
 287:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       customizer.
 288:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    2. Update thresholds if the SmartSense Full Auto-Tuning is enabled in
 289:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       the customizer.
 290:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    3. Update the Baselines and Difference counts for all sensors.
 291:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    4. Update the sensor and widget status (on/off), update centroid for
 292:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       sliders and X/Y position for touchpads.
 293:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 294:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Disabled widgets are not processed. To disable/enable a widget, set
 295:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  appropriate values in the
 296:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense_WDGT_ENABLE<RegisterNumber>_PARAM_ID register using the
 297:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense_SetParam() function.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lenovo\AppData\Local\Temp\cc5ZOoAI.s 			page 10


 298:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function should be called only after all the sensors in the component
 299:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  are scanned. Calling this function multiple times without sensor scanning
 300:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  causes unexpected behavior.
 301:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 302:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  If Self-test library is enabled this function executes baseline duplication
