 449:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 450:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \brief
 451:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Performs customized data processing on the selected widget.
 452:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 453:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \details
 454:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function performs data processes for the specified widget specified by
 455:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  the mode parameter. The execution order of the requested operations is from
 456:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  LSB to MSB of the mode parameter. If a different order is needed, this API
 457:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  can be called multiple times with the required mode parameter.
 458:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 459:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function can be used with any of the available scan functions. This
 460:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  function should be called only after all sensors in the specified widget are
 461:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  scanned. Calling this function multiple times with the same mode without
 462:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  sensor scanning causes unexpected behavior. This function ignores the value
 463:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  of the wdgtEnable register.
 464:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 465:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  The CapSense_PROCESS_CALC_NOISE and
 466:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense_PROCESS_THRESHOLDS flags are supported by the CSD sensing
 467:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  method only when the auto-tuning mode is enabled.
 468:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 469:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  The pipeline scan method (i.e. during scanning of a widget perform processing
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lenovo\AppData\Local\Temp\cc5ZOoAI.s 			page 16


 470:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  of a previously scanned widget) can be implemented using this function and it
 471:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  may reduce the total scan/process time, increase the refresh rate and
 472:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  decrease the power consumption.
 473:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 474:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  If Self-test library is enabled this function executes baseline duplication
 475:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  test. Refer to CapSense_CheckBaselineDuplication() for details.
 476:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 477:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \param widgetId
 478:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Specify the ID number of the widget to be processed.
 479:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  A macro for the widget ID can be found in the CapSense Configuration header
 480:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  file defined as CapSense_<WidgetName>_WDGT_ID.
 481:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** 
 482:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \param mode
 483:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Specify the type of widget processing that needs to be executed for the
 484:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  specified widget:
 485:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    1. Bits [31..6] - Reserved
 486:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    2. Bits [5..0] - CapSense_PROCESS_ALL - Execute all tasks
 487:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    3. Bit [5] - CapSense_PROCESS_STATUS - Update Status (on/off,
 488:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       centroid position)
 489:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    4. Bit [4] - CapSense_PROCESS_THRESHOLDS - Update Thresholds
 490:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       (only in CSD auto-tuning mode)
 491:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    5. Bit [3] - CapSense_PROCESS_CALC_NOISE - Calculate Noise (only in
 492:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       CSD auto-tuning mode)
 493:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    6. Bit [2] - CapSense_PROCESS_DIFFCOUNTS - Update Difference Counts
 494:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    7. Bit [1] - CapSense_PROCESS_BASELINE - Update Baselines
 495:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    8. Bit [0] - CapSense_PROCESS_FILTER - Run Firmware Filter
 496:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 497:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \return
 498:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Returns the status of the widget processing operation:
 499:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  - CYRET_SUCCESS if processing is successfully performed
 500:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  - CYRET_BAD_PARAM if the input parameter is invalid
 501:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  - CYRET_BAD_DATA if processing was failed
 502:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 503:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *******************************************************************************/
