 611:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** /*******************************************************************************
 612:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * Function Name: CapSense_ProcessSensorExt
 613:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** ****************************************************************************//**
 614:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 615:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \brief
 616:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Performs customized data processing on the selected widget's sensor.
 617:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 618:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \details
 619:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function performs data processes for the specified sensor specified by
 620:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  the mode parameter. The execution order of the requested operations is from
 621:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  LSB to MSB of the mode parameter. If a different order is needed, this
 622:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  function can be called multiple times with the required mode parameter.
 623:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 624:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  This function can be used with any of the available scan functions. This
 625:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  function should be called only after a specified sensor in the widget is
 626:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  scanned. Calling this function multiple times with the same mode without
 627:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  sensor scanning causes unexpected behavior. This function ignores the value
 628:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  of the wdgtEnable register.
 629:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 630:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  The CapSense_PROCESS_CALC_NOISE and
 631:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense_PROCESS_THRESHOLDS flags are supported by the CSD sensing
 632:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  method only when the auto-tuning mode is enabled.
 633:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 634:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  The pipeline scan method (i.e. during scanning of a sensor perform processing
 635:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  of a previously scanned sensor) can be implemented using this function and it
 636:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  may reduce the total scan/process time, increase the refresh rate and
 637:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  decrease the power consumption.
 638:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 639:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  If Self-test library is enabled this function executes baseline duplication
 640:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  test. Refer to CapSense_CheckBaselineDuplication() for details.
 641:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 642:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \param widgetId
 643:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Specify the ID number of the widget to process one of its sensors.
 644:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  A macro for the widget ID can be found in the
 645:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense Configuration header file defined as
 646:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense_<WidgetName>_WDGT_ID
 647:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 648:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \param sensorId
 649:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Specify the ID number of the sensor within the widget to process it.
 650:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  A macro for the sensor ID within a specified widget can be found in the
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lenovo\AppData\Local\Temp\cc5ZOoAI.s 			page 21


 651:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense Configuration header file defined as
 652:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  CapSense_<WidgetName>_SNS<SensorNumber>_ID
 653:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 654:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \param mode
 655:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Specify the type of the sensor processing that needs to be executed for the
 656:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  specified sensor:
 657:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    1. Bits [31..5] - Reserved
 658:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    2. Bits [4..0] - CapSense_PROCESS_ALL - Executes all tasks
 659:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    3. Bit [4] - CapSense_PROCESS_THRESHOLDS - Updates Thresholds (only
 660:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       in auto-tuning mode)
 661:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    4. Bit [3] - CapSense_PROCESS_CALC_NOISE - Calculates Noise (only
 662:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *       in auto-tuning mode)
 663:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    5. Bit [2] - CapSense_PROCESS_DIFFCOUNTS - Updates Difference Count
 664:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    6. Bit [1] - CapSense_PROCESS_BASELINE - Updates Baseline
 665:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *    7. Bit [0] - CapSense_PROCESS_FILTER - Runs Firmware Filter
 666:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 667:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** * \return
 668:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  Returns the status of the sensor process operation:
 669:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  - CYRET_SUCCESS if processing is successfully performed
 670:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  - CYRET_BAD_PARAM if the input parameter is invalid
 671:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *  - CYRET_BAD_DATA if processing was failed
 672:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *
 673:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Control.c **** *******************************************************************************/
